WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.387
[Steady Heart Monitor Beep and Weary Acoustic Guitar Intro]

00:00:17.387 --> 00:00:24.000
I'm in a room, the lights are dim, the monitor's a steady beep

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
I'm waiting for a bed to open, I'm trying just to sleep

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Aubrie's on the vinyl couch, she hasn't left my side

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
I'm starving, but the nurse just said my hands are tied

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:54.000
"It's just me again, it's midnight now"—click, the door swings open

00:00:54.941 --> 00:01:01.000
Click, the cuff is on his arm, the light is shining on him

00:01:01.305 --> 00:01:07.710
It's just another vitals check, another false alarm

00:01:08.011 --> 00:01:13.895
He's trying just to sleep, but he is NPO

00:01:13.995 --> 00:01:21.281
And I have got a promise that this night will be so slow

00:01:21.321 --> 00:01:29.493
It feels like just a minute, I start to drift away

00:01:29.633 --> 00:01:35.500
A hazy, anxious, fitful dream that's begging me to stay

00:01:36.778 --> 00:01:43.000
But then the sound, it pulls me back, the lock upon the door

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:51.000
The squeak of shoes upon the floor, I can't take anymore

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:57.853
"It's just me again, it's 2 AM"—click, the door swings open

00:01:57.853 --> 00:02:03.748
Click, the cuff is on his arm

00:02:03.748 --> 00:02:10.072
The light is shining on him, it's just another false alarm

00:02:10.512 --> 00:02:17.235
He's trying just to sleep, but he is NPO

00:02:17.296 --> 00:02:22.739
And I have got a promise that this night will be so slow

00:02:22.759 --> 00:02:30.483
I'm not a person, I'm a chart, a number on a screen

00:02:32.753 --> 00:02:41.056
The most annoying endless night that I have ever seen

00:02:41.156 --> 00:02:48.500
Aubrie's jolting on the sofa, she's getting zero sleep

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:56.000
This isn't care, this isn't rest, the hole is way too deep

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:03.000
"Good morning, it is 6 AM"—click, the lights are on now

00:03:07.112 --> 00:03:12.000
"Am I still NPO?"

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:37.860
[Bluesy Acoustic Guitar & Heart Monitor Interlude]

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:46.920
"I'm hungry..."
